Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.78,0:00:11.28,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Ms. Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.67,0:00:16.55,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,How may I assist you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.87,0:00:20.62,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh, uh... There's something \NI need your help with.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.56,0:00:22.87,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,"Something"?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.30,0:00:24.17,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,It's this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.17,0:00:27.95,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.95,0:00:31.54,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I know it's kind of a cliché to reinvent your \Nimage during summer vacation, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.54,0:00:34.57,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I've been wanting to get my ears pierced \Never since my friend did!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.57,0:00:37.51,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,But I don't have the guts to \Npierce them myself, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.00,0:00:40.60,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I was wondering if you could do it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.94,0:00:43.06,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,You would like me to?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.06,0:00:45.06,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I noticed your ears are pierced, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.06,0:00:48.65,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,so I was thinking it'd be safer to have \Nsomeone with experience do it, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.81,0:00:52.23,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.41,0:00:54.75,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.49,0:01:01.58,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Now, do me a favor and pierce them \Nwith one swift blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.33,0:01:16.30,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Ms. Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.30,0:01:20.06,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I-Is this some sort of hazing ritual \Nfor new employees?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.57,0:01:22.77,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Have I failed you in some way?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.77,0:01:23.85,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.85,0:01:25.30,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,My apologies!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.64,0:01:28.65,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I couldn't possibly do something as horrible
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.65,0:01:31.86,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,as opening a hole in your flesh, \NMaster Hitoyoshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.37,0:01:36.70,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Uh, didn't you used to put holes \Nin people for a living?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.57,0:01:41.80,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Um, Ms. Yuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.20,0:01:46.66,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs14\c&HD0461D&\fax0.05\pos(255,190.5)\frz14.61}Big Brother
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.20,0:01:46.66,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fs14\c&H535452&\fax0.05\frz14.61\pos(287,279.5)\3c&HDEDFDD&} I adopted a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.04,0:01:46.66,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Pup, pup, puppy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.01,0:01:48.36,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,I wonder what it's like...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.36,0:01:49.28,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Is it lively?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.28,0:01:51.25,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Is it shy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.89,0:01:52.75,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.09,0:01:56.10,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Big Brother! Show me the puppy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.41,0:02:06.48,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Would you happen to be \NMaster Hitoyoshi's little sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.49,0:03:44.45,Signs_EpTitle,CAPTION,0,0,0,,{\fad(273,1)\pos(604.5,285.5)\blur1}Episode {\c&H1227CD&}3{\c&H000000&}: {\c&H1227CD&}You{\c&H000000&} are Ms. Yuki.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:42.13,0:03:44.08,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.45,0:03:46.08,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,The house is so clean!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.20,0:03:47.87,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,The puppy is so fluffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.62,0:03:50.50,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,And on top of that...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.50,0:03:55.29,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,I had no idea there was \Nsuch a beautiful maid here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.21,0:03:58.03,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell me about her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.03,0:03:59.17,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Doh puhl mah cheechz!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.65,0:04:03.72,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,We've been texting all the time, \Nbut you haven't mentioned her once!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.05,0:04:08.93,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Well, I didn't want to risk Mom finding out \Nand getting worried, for one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.38,0:04:11.10,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,What did you say to Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.46,0:04:14.20,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I asked if I could hire a new housekeeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.68,0:04:17.06,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,He okayed it over the phone as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.41,0:04:21.97,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,I don't know whether Dad trusts you \Nor just neglects you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.97,0:04:23.99,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Wait! That's not the issue here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.99,0:04:27.12,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,How could you keep your little sister \Nin the dark like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.12,0:04:29.33,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,That's unforgivable behavior, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.26,0:04:34.00,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Do you both reside in separate houses?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.00,0:04:35.63,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.73,0:04:39.71,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.96,0:04:40.78,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.42,0:04:46.17,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,It's just... You're so beautiful, \NI can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.51,0:04:50.26,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Riko just loves beautiful people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.83,0:04:53.57,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,That's why I didn't want to tell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.57,0:04:54.98,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I knew she'd be annoying about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.23,0:04:59.15,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Doh putt youh fingers in mah mouse!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.15,0:05:00.78,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Big Brother, you jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.78,0:05:02.64,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,How could you keep her all to yourself?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.47,0:05:09.57,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Oh, I forgot to introduce myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.57,0:05:10.77,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,I'm Riko,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.77,0:05:13.38,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,younger sister to my fool \Nof an older brother here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.38,0:05:14.58,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Nice to meet ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.58,0:05:17.04,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Don't just slide in an insult.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.04,0:05:20.42,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,They say I'm a clever kid! Keep that \Nin mind when you Riko-ll my name!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.42,0:05:22.86,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,So what's your name, Miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.10,0:05:26.97,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I'm... Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.85,0:05:30.38,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,My name is Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.38,0:05:32.27,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,What a wonderful name!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.27,0:05:33.06,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,It is!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.62,0:05:36.94,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Master Hitoyoshi was kind \Nenough to give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.94,0:05:38.20,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.20,0:05:41.52,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,And here I thought Big Brother \Nhad no naming ability whatsoever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.52,0:05:44.65,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Wait, he {\i1}gave{\i0} it to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.65,0:05:47.95,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Indeed. I was formerly an assassin, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.95,0:05:48.98,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Ms. Yuki, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.98,0:05:53.12,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,...as I did not have a specific name, \NI asked him to grant me one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.71,0:05:58.33,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,For real.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.17,0:06:01.93,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,That's so... so...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.66,0:06:05.15,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.15,0:06:06.26,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Phew...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.26,0:06:09.22,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,You're beautiful {\i1}and{\i0} strong... It's perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.22,0:06:10.65,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,May I have your autograph?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.65,0:06:11.89,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,My autograph...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.89,0:06:14.01,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,All you have to do is write \Nyour name down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.89,0:06:14.01,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(1357,1)\bord2.5\fnComic Sans MS\c&H537CE8&\3c&HEAF3F4&}Riko{\c&H1E2135&}-chan's Clever Notebook\N8th Edition
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.01,0:06:16.90,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Come on! Come on! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.69,0:06:22.19,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,If that is your wish, I shall write it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.83,0:06:31.62,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,She looks picture-perfect just sitting there...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.61,0:06:36.42,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,She's more like an upper-class lady \Nthan an assassin!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.42,0:06:37.64,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I've finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.51,0:06:39.37,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.37,0:06:43.59,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs30\bord2.5\fnComic Sans MS\c&H424243&\3c&HE7F2F3&}Yuki
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.47,0:06:43.03,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Will this do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.89,0:06:46.92,DefaultItalics,RIKO {M},0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.92,0:06:49.30,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI and RIKO {M},0,0,0,,Not exactly what I had in mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.58,0:06:52.26,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Oh! Is it not to your liking?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.26,0:06:54.45,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Oh, no, it's nothing like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.45,0:06:57.52,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,I was just noticing your unique handwriting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.52,0:07:02.18,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Spoken communication is my strong point. \NIn fact, I speak around twelve languages.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.18,0:07:03.23,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Wow, Ms. Global!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.58,0:07:06.86,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I was sent all around the world \Nfor my job, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.86,0:07:08.81,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.81,0:07:12.40,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,However, I was never taught calligraphy,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.40,0:07:15.66,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,so I must apologize for showing you \Nsomething so unsightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.92,0:07:20.37,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,It's okay. This is cute in its own way, \Nsince it looks like an idol's autograph.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.06,0:07:23.83,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,If so, I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.83,0:07:26.65,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Oh! I thought of a great idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.65,0:07:27.87,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Great idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.87,0:07:32.06,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Yep! For this year's summer vacation \Nresearch assignment, my subject will be...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.06,0:07:33.30,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Ms. Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.30,0:07:35.72,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,You've already made up your mind, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.51,0:07:37.91,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Is that okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.91,0:07:39.73,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,If you are okay with one such as me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.86,0:07:42.52,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,You're the only one for me, Ms. Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.37,0:07:46.69,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Now, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.69,0:07:49.26,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Show me your killer moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.26,0:07:49.90,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.28,0:07:55.21,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Riko! Don't write anything \Nweird for school, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.21,0:07:56.91,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Perish the thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.91,0:08:02.28,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,I'll be writing a killer diary of my killer \Nnotes on a beautiful maid's killer skills!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.28,0:08:05.68,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,What? Are you sure that's going to be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.68,0:08:06.59,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Miss Riko.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.45,0:08:11.76,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Please step out into the yard, if you would.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.29,0:08:14.33,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Roger dodger!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.08,0:08:21.35,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Whoa... Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.35,0:08:25.19,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,All right, here I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.90,0:08:31.61,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.25,0:08:35.84,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.54,0:08:39.95,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Hey, Ms. Yuki! Where did you \Npull that knife from just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.95,0:08:41.30,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,From my breast pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.30,0:08:44.04,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,How many do you have? \NWhere do you keep them?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.04,0:08:45.92,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I originally carried sixteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.29,0:08:47.79,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Sixteen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.79,0:08:52.34,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,However, I was told that it was \Ntoo many by Master Hitoyoshi,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.75,0:08:54.65,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,and so I carry five now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.65,0:08:56.30,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Where are those five?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.30,0:08:59.26,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,One is in my breast pocket, \Nand as for the rest...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.29,0:09:03.45,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I have two attached to each leg \Nvia garters, for five in total.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.45,0:09:04.73,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.73,0:09:06.84,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.61,0:09:13.61,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Wow, what a cute bell!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.61,0:09:15.48,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.48,0:09:17.53,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,But doesn't it interfere with your work?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.53,0:09:21.33,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,By the time my target hears the bell, \NI have already dealt the killing blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.33,0:09:23.68,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.68,0:09:25.72,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,I want to try saying that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.72,0:09:28.04,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,"By the time my target hears the bell..."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.20,0:09:38.22,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Everyone totally heard \Nyour stomach growling, Riko.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.71,0:09:42.48,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Well, I can't do anything \Nabout that! I'm hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.48,0:09:43.68,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.09,0:09:47.65,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Well, it {\i1}is{\i0} lunch time. \NWhy don't we make something?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.65,0:09:48.75,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.75,0:09:50.76,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,What's your specialty dish, Ms. Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.76,0:09:51.40,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.73,0:09:54.48,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if I can call it a dish, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.81,0:09:57.11,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,That's just what I want to see!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.15,0:10:02.47,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Isn't this where...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.57,0:10:06.04,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,you'd go all "whoosh" with the knife?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.04,0:10:12.04,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yes, but I've come to realize that this \Nis the most efficient way to cut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.96,0:10:17.36,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.97,0:10:26.94,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Well, I guess cabbage on its own \Ndoesn't make a meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.94,0:10:29.88,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,We can probably eat it with something tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.44,0:10:31.11,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.77,0:10:33.65,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,300)\an7\bord0.5\shad1}Katsuda Fireworks Festival\N{\fs16}Time: 19:30-20:15
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.77,0:10:35.48,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,1)\bord2\fs28\fnArial Black\an9\c&HFBFCF6&\3c&H4B4DD1&\blur1}Summer Festival
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.98,0:10:35.48,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Hey, today is the summer festival!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.48,0:10:36.53,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,I wanna go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.53,0:10:37.94,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.27,0:10:40.92,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,They have a certain something there \Nyou'll like, Ms. Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.92,0:10:42.20,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.20,0:10:44.95,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs16\fnTimes New Roman\bord2\c&H9B9AA0&\3c&HFCF9F5&\pos(73,12)}Katsuda's Sauce
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.83,0:10:44.95,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,A stall for senbei crackers \Nserved with {\i1}that{\i0} sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.20,0:10:49.83,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Sauce... Senbei...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.69,0:10:55.75,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,U-Um, Master Hitoyoshi...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.76,0:11:01.26,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Fine by me. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.51,0:11:05.06,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,300)\an7\bord0.5\shad1}Katsuda Fireworks Festival\N{\fs16}Time: 19:30-20:15
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.51,0:11:10.02,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,1)\bord2\fs28\fnArial Black\an9\c&HFBFCF6&\3c&H4B4DD1&\blur1}Summer Festival
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.81,0:11:08.16,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Then it's decided! \NSummer festival, here we come!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.02,0:11:13.98,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fnArial Black\an9\c&HDD996A&\3c&HF4EBEC&}Shaved Ice
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.02,0:11:13.98,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fnArial Black\an8\c&H0F3E55&\3c&H88B9D8&}Yakisoba
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.02,0:11:13.98,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fnArial Black\an7\c&H08154B&\3c&H2359CD&}Takoyaki
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.46,0:11:16.23,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,It's looking fun already!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.67,0:11:17.78,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Now, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.78,0:11:18.99,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.50,0:11:21.38,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.20,0:11:26.16,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\bord2.5\fnArial Black\c&H2B0B8D&\3c&H040E28&\fax0.2\pos(344.5,42)\frz348.7}Shooting Gallery
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.82,0:11:47.20,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Sh-Shooting... is not my forte.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.90,0:11:53.65,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.65,0:11:55.11,Default,GOLDFISH STALL OLD MAN,0,0,0,,What the?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.11,0:11:58.64,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,P-Please give me some pointers, goldfish pro!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.64,0:12:00.57,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,The trick is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.94,0:12:05.16,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,to erase any hint of your presence \Nand swiftly strike the target from behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.16,0:12:06.41,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.90,0:12:10.25,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Put more flex into it, \Nfrom your wrist to your fingertips.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.25,0:12:11.02,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.02,0:12:13.12,Default,GOLDFISH STALL OLD MAN,0,0,0,,You're a lucky girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.12,0:12:15.33,Default,GOLDFISH STALL OLD MAN,0,0,0,,You have a nice big sister looking after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.27,0:12:17.54,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.30,0:12:25.22,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs16\fad(941,1)\fscx80\bord2\fax-0.56\fnTimes New Roman\c&H37414F&\3c&HF3F6FB&\frz19.7\pos(101,198)}Katsuda's Sauce
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.30,0:12:25.22,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs16\fad(941,1)\fscx80\bord2\fax-0.56\fnTimes New Roman\c&H37414F&\3c&HF3F6FB&\frz19.7\pos(233.5,153)}Katsuda's Sauce
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.30,0:12:25.22,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs16\fad(941,1)\fscx82\bord2\fax-0.48\fnTimes New Roman\c&H37414F&\3c&HF3F6FB&\frz19.7\pos(391,97)}Katsuda's Sauce
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.69,0:12:25.22,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Ka...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.26,0:12:28.43,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fnTimes New Roman\c&H37414F&\3c&HF3F6FB&}Katsuda's Sauce
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.81,0:12:28.43,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Katsuda's... Sauce...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.43,0:12:31.72,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Wow, it's really here! \NIsn't that great, Ms. Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.62,0:12:34.68,Default,SENBEI STALL OLD MAN,0,0,0,,Here ya go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.32,0:12:45.28,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,1)\fs16\fnTimes New Roman\bord2\c&H8A8A8F&\3c&HFCF9F5&\pos(533,29)}Katsuda's Sauce
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.73,0:12:42.09,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Sauce... Yummy...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.09,0:12:45.28,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,The sauce is... yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.94,0:12:49.95,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,She's like a squirrel!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.33,0:12:55.20,Default,SENBEI STALL OLD MAN,0,0,0,,I like the way you're enjoying it, Miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.20,0:12:56.43,Default,SENBEI STALL OLD MAN,0,0,0,,It makes me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.41,0:12:59.29,Default,SENBEI STALL OLD MAN,0,0,0,,Here, have another on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.01,0:13:05.26,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,226)\fnArial Black\bord2\fs14\c&H505DB2&\3c&HCDF4F3&\pos(557,271.5)}Sauce Senbei\N500 yen
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.01,0:13:06.47,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\bord2.5\fs26\fnArial Black\c&H2549A4&\3c&H0F274A&\pos(320,34)}Sauce Senbei
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.36,0:13:05.47,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Wait, wait! I'll go buy a drink for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.47,0:13:06.47,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Riko?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.85,0:13:09.67,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Don't worry! I'll be right back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.05,0:13:12.64,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Jeez...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.64,0:13:15.21,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,If we move around, I feel like \Nwe'll lose each other even more,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.21,0:13:16.92,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,so let's just wait over there for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.45,0:13:28.62,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I didn't know festivals were like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.18,0:13:32.08,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Ms. Yuki, you've never been \Nto a festival before?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.08,0:13:33.04,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.78,0:13:37.71,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,To me, the day of a festival meant...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.11,0:14:27.13,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Whoa...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.14,0:14:37.98,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,So pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.86,0:14:43.35,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Here you go, Ms. Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.19,0:14:45.11,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,1)\bord2\fnTimes New Roman\c&HA5AFC1&\3c&H404CAD&}Ramune
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.40,0:14:48.44,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Summer festivals are the best, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.34,0:14:57.18,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.51,0:15:05.43,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Whoa! Oh, man...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.15,0:15:09.01,DefaultTop,RIKO,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.93,0:15:10.11,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,You shook it, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.46,0:15:19.60,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,I'm so satisfied!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.60,0:15:22.60,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,We even got to buy some sauce senbei \Nas a souvenir, too! Right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.60,0:15:23.54,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.89,0:15:26.11,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.11,0:15:29.78,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,If I recall correctly, \Nyou've already eaten eight of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.11,0:15:29.78,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\bord2\an7\c&H18120C&\3c&HA0968C&}Ms. Yuki's data\N* Sauce Senbei: 8\N* Ramune:
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.13,0:15:32.06,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,so hold off on having any more today!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.19,0:15:33.99,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.66,0:15:37.13,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,I'm not sure who's the big sister anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.49,0:15:39.45,Default,SNATCHER,0,0,0,,You're in my way! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.62,0:15:42.73,Default,WOMAN,0,0,0,,Someone! Please catch that man!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.73,0:15:43.79,Default,WOMAN,0,0,0,,He stole my bag!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.79,0:15:45.50,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Riko! Ms. Yuki! Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.50,0:15:46.42,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.18,0:15:56.31,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.04,0:16:00.18,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,What's wrong?! \NDid you hurt yourself somewhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.18,0:16:05.90,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Th-This is the first time anyone \Nbesides Dad carried me like a princess...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.42,0:16:08.36,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I'm glad you seem okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.75,0:16:12.27,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Oh... Ms. Yuki's sauce senbei...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.09,0:16:15.16,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,This is terrible...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.62,0:16:19.04,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Seriously, bad people like him \Nshould receive divine punishment!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.04,0:16:21.12,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Divine... punishment?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.40,0:16:24.74,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,On top of stealing, he almost killed someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.74,0:16:26.46,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,It's normal to think that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.38,0:16:29.59,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.59,0:16:30.63,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.30,0:16:35.03,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,M-Ms. Yuki?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.01,0:16:39.47,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh, man, there she goes...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.47,0:16:41.64,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Big Brother! We have to go after Ms. Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.64,0:16:43.36,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Yeah... I'm worried about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.36,0:16:47.94,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,My diary won't be complete without an \Naccount of Ms. Yuki shanking an evildoer!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.25,0:16:50.30,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Don't say something like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.06,0:16:52.87,Default,SNATCHER,0,0,0,,Heh, piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.42,0:16:55.98,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,I see Ms. Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.58,0:17:01.62,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,She's amazing! Ms. Yuki is like a superhero!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.62,0:17:02.75,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,This isn't the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.45,0:17:08.14,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Big Brother, if we go this way, \Nwe might be able to meet up with her!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.14,0:17:08.84,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.42,0:17:15.75,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,If she causes an incident \Nout in the open like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.20,0:17:38.27,Default,SNATCHER,0,0,0,,D-Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.40,0:17:48.25,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Ms. Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.88,0:17:58.44,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Don't kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.43,0:18:02.81,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,This is divine punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.98,0:18:12.48,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Master Hitoyoshi...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.83,0:18:17.20,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Being normal certainly makes my stomach growl.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.14,0:18:22.16,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,You want to go buy more sauce senbei?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.53,0:18:24.99,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Yay! I'm gonna have some, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.99,0:18:26.78,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Didn't you say to hold off for today?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.78,0:18:28.12,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,That doesn't apply to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.27,0:18:29.46,DefaultTop,WOMAN,0,0,0,,That's him! The snatcher!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.46,0:18:32.38,DefaultTop,POLICEMAN,0,0,0,,Hey, you! I'm going to have to ask you \Nto come with me to the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.06,0:18:36.59,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Come on. I said I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.18,0:18:38.92,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,I can go home by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.92,0:18:43.08,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Absolutely not. It's late, and way\Ntoo many things happened today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.08,0:18:45.95,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,It's late {\i1}because{\i0} so many \Nthings happened today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.95,0:18:47.23,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,You've got it all backwards!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.23,0:18:49.29,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Just wait 'til I tell everyone what happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.29,0:18:50.48,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,They'll be blown away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.09,0:18:52.23,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,"Everyone"...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.23,0:18:55.45,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,This ended up being the best \Nresearch assignment ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.45,0:18:59.44,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Are these "research assignments" \Nsomething that everyone does, as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.44,0:19:00.95,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Yep, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.24,0:19:05.45,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Have you ever been to school before, Ms. Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.45,0:19:07.48,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,School?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.48,0:19:12.88,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Yeah! You study, and chitchat \Nwith friends, and join clubs!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.88,0:19:15.59,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,School is a super fun place!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.59,0:19:20.18,DefaultTop,RIKO,0,0,0,,Wow! Beef stew?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.59,0:19:20.18,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs14\c&HD0461D&\frz345.7\pos(279,143.5)}Mom
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.59,0:19:20.18,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord2\fs12\c&H656664&\frz345.7\3c&HDEDFDD&\pos(311.5,208)}I'll have Big Brother\Ntake me home, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.59,0:19:20.18,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord2\fs12\c&H656664&\3c&HDEDFDD&\pos(224,268.5)\frz344.8}Take care.\NWe're having beef stew tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.18,0:19:22.83,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,I'm suddenly super hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.83,0:19:24.67,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,I wanna head home in a flash!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.67,0:19:26.10,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.10,0:19:28.19,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Big Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.19,0:19:30.73,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Jeez, she comes and goes like a whirlwind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.73,0:19:31.44,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Seriously...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.44,0:19:34.73,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yes. But she's a lot of fun to be around.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.29,0:19:36.87,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I guess it's okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.17,0:19:37.32,DefaultTop,RIKO {overlap},0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.32,0:19:39.99,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Is that... what "normal"...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.82,0:19:42.34,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,looks like?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.98,0:19:45.52,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,If that's the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.91,0:19:49.52,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I want to go to school, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.51,0:19:54.73,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Come to think of it, I never asked \Nhow old Ms. Yuki is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.68,0:19:59.86,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Yeah, if you want to make friends and stuff, \Ngoing to school might work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.86,0:20:01.30,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Why not give it a try?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.19,0:20:12.98,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {N},0,0,0,,And before I knew it, that storm-like \NAugust had already swept through,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.03,0:20:15.92,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {N},0,0,0,,and the new semester had begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.21,0:20:24.98,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,I hope Ms. Yuki will be all right on her own...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.98,0:20:26.63,Default,TAIGA,0,0,0,,Hey! Hitoyoshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.12,0:20:29.28,Default,TAIGA,0,0,0,,Did you hear the rumors?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.28,0:20:30.30,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Rumors?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.30,0:20:31.04,Default,TAIGA,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.04,0:20:35.25,Default,TAIGA,0,0,0,,There've been sightings of a super \Npretty maid appearing around town!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.79,0:20:38.03,Default,TAIGA,0,0,0,,Aw, gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.03,0:20:39.25,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,My bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.64,0:20:41.76,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Well, she does stand out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.76,0:20:45.22,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,And even after the summer festival, \Nshe often went for walks with Riko, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.64,0:20:48.99,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah? I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.99,0:20:51.22,Default,TAIGA,0,0,0,,Ha! I win!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.22,0:20:53.42,Default,TAIGA,0,0,0,,Well, I've never seen her in person, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.42,0:20:55.19,Default,KOBACHI,0,0,0,,I saw her at the library.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.53,0:20:58.90,Default,KOBACHI,0,0,0,,For a cosplay, she really went all out with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.34,0:21:00.42,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,The library?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.42,0:21:03.15,Default,HOMEROOM TEACHER,0,0,0,,All right, everyone take your seats!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.15,0:21:06.27,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Why was she at the library?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.27,0:21:10.28,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Well, at least no one's found out \Nabout her living at my place...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.62,0:21:16.42,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,396)\bord2\fnTimes New Roman\an9\c&H5CBA2A&\3c&HF7FAF8&}Rich Flavor\NMilk
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.99,0:21:14.01,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,I don't want to kick off the new semester with a bombardment of questions,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.01,0:21:15.85,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,so I think I'll keep it on the down low...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.85,0:21:19.72,Default,HOMEROOM TEACHER,0,0,0,,I know this is sudden, but I have a new \Ntransfer student to introduce to you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.05,0:21:25.97,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\bord2.5\fnTimes New Roman\c&HEAF0EC&\3c&H3D5B3F&\pos(495,13)}Yuki Yokoya
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.97,0:21:23.62,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I am Yuki Yokoya.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.04,0:21:25.97,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Please call me Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.72,0:21:28.93,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fs20\fnTimes New Roman\an9\c&H64A531&\3c&HF4F7F4&}Rich Flavor\N{\c&H5D40BA&}Made from 100% Milk
